### Open route bypasses scoped BEARERJWT middleware
GET /open
=> 200

{"public": true}

### Missing Authorization header returns 401
GET /jwt/me
=> 401

{"error": "UNAUTHORIZED"}

### Non-Bearer scheme returns 401
GET /jwt/me
Authorization: Basic dXNlcjpwYXNz
=> 401

{"error": "UNAUTHORIZED"}

### Invalid JWT signature returns 401
GET /jwt/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIxMjM0NTY3ODkwIiwiZXhwIjo0MTAyNDQ0ODAwfQ.invalidsignature
=> 401

{"error": "UNAUTHORIZED"}
